del	Delete a contact
for loop	View/search contacts
.title()	Format names
.lower()	Case-insensitive search
if / elif / else	Handle menu options
while True	Keep the contact book running
int()	Convert phone number/menu input to integers
len()	Not used in this project
String search	Find partial name matches

Note: len() is not actually used in the Day 21 code, so it isn't part of the implementation.



